# sys-gym-snowpoint (docs/research/gym-puzzles.md): Snowpoint Gym's ice and
# snowballs. Ice slides on in the moving direction; the surface a quarter tile ahead speeds the slide up going
# down (WALK_FAST, SLIGHTLY_FASTER, FASTER) and slows it going up, stepping back WALK_SLOW below speed 0; a
# snowball ahead breaks at speed 1 or more (deleted, no flag), at speed 0 it stops the slide. The route (a
# search over the engine's own moves: hold a direction until the player moves, let the slide settle) breaks 8
# of the 19 balls to reach Candice; a save round trip keeps the broken ones gone; leaving and coming back
# brings all 19 back. The game seed is pinned for the turning trainers.
party 0 platinum:SPECIES_INFERNAPE 80 platinum:MOVE_FLAMETHROWER platinum:MOVE_CLOSE_COMBAT platinum:MOVE_EARTHQUAKE platinum:MOVE_FIRE_PUNCH
party 1 platinum:SPECIES_LUCARIO 80 platinum:MOVE_AURA_SPHERE platinum:MOVE_FLASH_CANNON platinum:MOVE_CLOSE_COMBAT platinum:MOVE_EARTHQUAKE
set state seed 4242
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_SNOWPOINT_CITY_GYM 11 28 up
until idle
